   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **If You Touch Me I’m Going to Scream Part I**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Big Decisions**: rare: 11 archived performances [5]\n- **Magic Bullet**: rare: 7 archived performances [5]\n- **If You Touch Me I’m Going to Scream Part II**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2019-08-03.CM33** (recommended): audience recording; 22 songs; 163 min; rated 4.5/5 by 2 [1]\n- **mm2019-08-03**: source not stated; 23 songs; 161 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Second night of a two-night stand at Red Rocks Amphitheatre [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2019-08-03.CM33**: taped by opsopcopolis; transferred by opsopcopolis; source: AUD [1]\n- **mm2019-08-03**: taped by Alex Leary; transferred by Alex Leary; source: DPA 4023 > Sound Devices MixPre-6 (24/48) [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Guy Burwell: [My Morning Jacket Live Archive - 2019-08-02 Red Rocks Amphitheatre - Morrison, CO](https://archive.mymorningjacket.net/index.php/shows/2019-shows/2019-08-02-red-rocks-amphitheatre-morrison-co) [6]\n- Fan art by Guy Burwell: [My Morning Jacket Live Archive - 2019-08-02 Red Rocks Amphitheatre - Morrison, CO](https://archive.mymorningjacket.net/index.php/shows/2019-shows/2019-08-02-red-rocks-amphitheatre-morrison-co) [7]\n- Poster by Guy Burwell: [My Morning Jacket Live Archive - 2019-08-02 Red Rocks Amphitheatre - Morrison, CO](https://archive.mymorningjacket.net/index.php/shows/2019-shows/2019-08-02-red-rocks-amphitheatre-morrison-co) [8]",
